flowchart TD
    A[Current proposed action] --> B{Successful receipt already exists?}
    B -->|Yes| N[NO FURTHER ACTION for this proposal]
    B -->|No| C[Assess all required facts and custom holds]
    C --> D{Any blockers?}
    D -->|No| X[ACT]
    X --> Y[Record simulated intent, receipt and result]
    Y --> N
    D -->|Yes| E[Retain every blocker; choose headline by priority]
    E --> S[STOP ACTION: refusal, rejection or stop rule]
    E --> H[HUMAN REVIEW: evidence, authority or judgement required]
    E --> Q[CLARIFY: request information through a verified route]
    E --> W[WAIT: pending triage, event or deadline]
    S --> R[New evidence, valid review or revised proposal]
    H --> R
    Q --> R
    W --> R
    R --> C
